      "title": "Swaraj Engines Limited Announces Compliance Officer Changes",
      "body": "Swaraj Engines Limited at its meeting held on April 13, 2026, considered, noted and approved the cessation of Ms. Geeta Kharat (ICSI Membership No. ACS-51135) as Compliance Officer of the Company due to her resignation with effect from close of June 12, 2026 for better growth and career opportunity. The Board of Directors of the Company at its meeting held on April 13, 2026, inter alia considered and approved the appointment of Mr. Nayan Jain (ICSI Membership No. ACS-79769) as Compliance Officer of the Company with effect from June 13, 2026. Mr. Nayan Jain will also be Key Managerial Personnel (KMP) and Senior Management Personnel of the Company. Mr. Nayan Jain is an Associate Member of the Institute of Company Secretaries of India (ICSI) and currently working in Corporate Secretarial Team",
